   Included:
   - harness/frontend/examples/openfhe_*.{params.json,trace.jsonl,fhecheck.json}: parameter dumps
     and operation traces recorded from OpenFHE running this project's driver
     (harness/frontend/openfhe/bgv_demo.cpp), and files derived from them; likewise
     harness/frontend/tests/values/*/ (parameters, traces and decrypted values of small-ring
     OpenFHE runs).
   - harness/frontend/openfhe/{bgv_demo,bfv_demo}.cpp and fhecheck-tracer.h are this project's own
