     observation-only tracing hooks. Its new files src/core/include/utils/tracing.h and
     simpletracer.h are byte-identical to the files of the fork above (commit 7e2eafc) and carry
     no copyright or licence header there either; the hooks in the patched OpenFHE files are
     ported from the same fork into files that carry OpenFHE's notice. The patch's
     src/pke/include/utils/fhecheck-tracer.h is this project's own (Apache-2.0);
     src/pke/include/plaintext-ser.h carries OpenFHE's own notice.
   - Python and Lean models that follow OpenFHE routines step by step, citing file:line
     (harness/bfv-rns, harness/bfv-float; Challenge/BFVMul/, FHE/Pin/Algo*,
     Challenge/Realize/OpenFHE.lean, FHE/Check/Security.lean). They are our own code written from
     reading the C++, not copies; they implement OpenFHE's algorithms and constants, and the
     attribution applies.
