     parameters recorded from openfheorg/openfhe-network-examples @1cee5bfe
     (src/threshold_fhe_aborts/threshold_fhe.cpp; BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2022, OpenFHE) built
     unmodified; no source of that program is included.

