2. Google HEIR
   Upstream:  https://github.com/google/heir
   Version:   nightly release tagged nightly-2026.11.11, commit
              86d9fc0acd760bee21003830a6cfba54d6182bec (binary heir-opt-manylinux_2_28_x86_64,
              sha256 ff9a597eb115dcf6ad29d21ee599b25a6b9d278d70dec6abdb0a9b93bc5f078b);
              source inputs from tests/Examples/common/{mult_dep_8,dot_product_8,cmux}.mlir at
