              was used only to read HEIR's source for citations; no fixture comes from it.)
   Licence:   Apache-2.0 (copyright the HEIR authors).

   Included:
   - harness/frontend/examples/heir_*.mlir (4 files): verbatim heir-opt output on HEIR's example
     programs; harness/frontend/examples/heir_*.fhecheck.json are derived from them.

3. Lattigo (Tune Insight SA and contributors)
   Upstream:  https://github.com/tuneinsight/lattigo, v6.2.0 (harness/lattigo-pin) and v6.1.0
              (the version HEIR's go.mod pins, harness/frontend/examples/heir_*)
   Licence:   Apache-2.0.
   No Lattigo source is included. harness/lattigo-pin/export/main.go is this project's own
   program written against Lattigo's public API (the module is fetched at build time; go.sum
   holds checksums only); harness/lattigo-pin/fixtures* are its outputs. The heir_*.lattigo.*.mlir
   files contain parameters that HEIR's Lattigo backend emitted.

4. Lean 4 and Mathlib
   Lean 4 (https://github.com/leanprover/lean4, Apache-2.0) and Mathlib
   (https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4, Apache-2.0), with Mathlib's dependencies
   pinned in lake-manifest.json, are build dependencies fetched at build time. They are not
   redistributed in this repository.

5. Third-party programs used by the evaluation, not redistributed
   - julenbernabe/bgv-extend-openfhe (https://github.com/julenbernabe/bgv-extend-openfhe),
     commit be4d8d10892445d8720c0f067588999404c78117: OpenFHE BGV programs (comparison, sign,
     integer division) that harness/eval/analyzer-speed/real/run.sh fetches at that commit and
     builds. No source of it is included. The shipped
     harness/eval/analyzer-speed/real/bgv-extend-params.diff holds only this project's added lines
     (environment-variable overrides of OpenFHE parameter inputs) and hunk headers naming the
     patched file; results.tsv and reports/ hold fhe_check output on the traced runs.
   - hmchoe0528/NEW_INDCPAD_HE (https://github.com/hmchoe0528/NEW_INDCPAD_HE), commit
     8d057909e0fe2d57e74c7facd0d99fd934f7d3ab: the public code of Choe, Kang and Stehle, "New
     IND-CPA-D Attacks on BFV and BGV". harness/eval/cks26/cks26.cpp is this project's own code,
     written from their paper and a reading of that code, citing it by file and line; no code of
     it is copied.
